WEBVTT

00:02.960 --> 00:05.670
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

01:25.290 --> 01:29.960
<b>THE ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

01:39.550 --> 01:41.760
<b><i>Courageous death in combat.</i></b>

01:41.850 --> 01:43.430
<b><i>Honorable suicide.</i></b>

01:44.020 --> 01:47.020
<b><i>A warrior's honor is awarded 
only through battle and death.</i></b>

01:48.810 --> 01:53.440
<b><i>Takauji Ashikaga, a hero</i></b>

01:54.070 --> 01:57.650
<b><i>who flourished during this turbulent time…</i></b>

01:59.950 --> 02:02.030
<b>A HISTORY OF JAPAN NANBOKUCHO PERIOD</b>

02:02.120 --> 02:03.280
<b><i>…wasn't the protagonist.</i></b>

02:05.830 --> 02:07.540
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

02:08.710 --> 02:10.920
<b>YEAR OF 1333 - KAMAKURA 
WAKAMIYAOJI SHOGUNATE SITE</b>

02:11.000 --> 02:12.670
<b>It is time for archery practice.</b>

02:13.800 --> 02:16.380
<b>You can't run away anymore, Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

02:19.050 --> 02:20.050
<b>Sorry.</b>

02:23.470 --> 02:25.060
<b>How nimble!</b>

02:25.140 --> 02:27.680
<b>Fool! It's not the time to be impressed!</b>

02:40.240 --> 02:42.320
<b>You'll slip and fall, Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

02:42.410 --> 02:43.780
<b>Please come down.</b>

02:44.450 --> 02:46.660
<b>You don't want to get hurt!</b>

02:47.620 --> 02:50.170
<b>Someone stop him!</b>

02:50.790 --> 02:52.670
<b>What's all this commotion?</b>

02:52.750 --> 02:55.420
<b>We're in the middle of Takauji's send-off.</b>

02:57.010 --> 02:59.090
<b>But Lord Tokiyuki--</b>

02:59.170 --> 03:01.010
<b>What of the Young Lord?</b>

03:03.010 --> 03:05.470
<b>Huh? What an escape artist.</b>

03:06.100 --> 03:07.810
<b>That's enough. You may go.</b>

03:07.890 --> 03:09.600
<b>But, sir…</b>

03:11.350 --> 03:12.980
<b>Excuse me, will you let me through?</b>

03:16.520 --> 03:21.070
<b>As always, you're a masterful player 
of hide-and-seek, Young Lord.</b>

03:21.650 --> 03:23.160
<b>Mr. Takauji.</b>

03:25.490 --> 03:27.040
<b>Takauji Ashikaga.</b>

03:27.740 --> 03:32.790
<b>I depart today for Kyo to quell the 
former Emperor Godaigo's uprising.</b>

03:33.670 --> 03:38.300
<b>I wish to prove my allegiance to you, 
our future leader, and the Hojo clan.</b>

03:38.880 --> 03:41.550
<b>I put my trust in you.</b>

03:41.630 --> 03:43.840
<b>I pray the gods be with us</b>

03:43.930 --> 03:46.680
<b>and may they bestow prosperity to 
Kamakura and the warrior families.</b>

03:48.640 --> 03:52.190
<b>Now, let's get going.</b>

03:52.270 --> 03:53.440
<b>Yes.</b>

03:56.020 --> 03:58.320
<b>Don't get nervous over Takauji.</b>

03:58.400 --> 03:59.570
<b>Kiyoko.</b>

03:59.650 --> 04:02.240
<b>You are the rightful heir of the shogunate.</b>

04:02.320 --> 04:05.320
<b>One day, you'll be giving him orders.</b>

04:06.620 --> 04:07.620
<b>SQUEEZE</b>

04:06.620 --> 04:10.830
<b>And I'm going to be your betrothed, 
too, so keep your head up.</b>

04:10.910 --> 04:13.330
<b>Funny, I don't remember 
making such a promise.</b>

04:13.420 --> 04:15.290
<b>-Smooch. -Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

04:15.380 --> 04:17.210
<b>Where did he run off to?</b>

04:17.290 --> 04:18.800
<b>I'll bet he's hiding nearby.</b>

04:18.880 --> 04:20.130
<b>Sorry, I gotta go, Kiyoko.</b>

04:20.630 --> 04:21.840
<b>Catch you later!</b>

04:23.220 --> 04:24.220
<b>There he goes.</b>

04:25.140 --> 04:26.300
<b>Good grief.</b>

04:26.890 --> 04:29.890
<b>All that boy is good at 
is running and hiding.</b>

04:30.390 --> 04:34.140
<b>Technically, they're both samurai, but 
Lord Tokiyuki is nothing like Takauji.</b>

04:34.730 --> 04:36.980
<b>It's true he will inherit the shogunate,</b>

04:37.060 --> 04:40.320
<b>but he's only going to be a puppet 
ruler, just like his father.</b>

04:40.400 --> 04:42.820
<b>All right, Lord Takatoki?</b>

04:42.900 --> 04:45.990
<b>We'll handle the rest.</b>

04:46.070 --> 04:47.070
<b>'Kay.</b>

04:48.530 --> 04:51.410
<b>What's wrong with being 
a puppet ruler, Father?</b>

04:51.490 --> 04:53.750
<b>They still get to lead lavish lives.</b>

04:53.830 --> 04:57.170
<b>Lord Tokiyuki lacks talent, 
and he's weak-willed,</b>

04:57.250 --> 04:58.960
<b>but he is kind.</b>

04:59.040 --> 05:00.550
<b>He's the perfect marriage candidate</b>

05:00.630 --> 05:02.960
<b>for someone from such a 
distinguished house as myself!</b>

05:03.670 --> 05:05.510
<b>He's nowhere to be found.</b>

05:05.590 --> 05:08.550
<b>We're powerless once the Young Lord 
starts taking hiding seriously.</b>

05:08.640 --> 05:13.480
<b>Remember the commotion when he hid 
inside a chest of armor for two days?</b>

05:13.560 --> 05:14.980
<b>Rather than all that trouble,</b>

05:15.060 --> 05:17.480
<b>wouldn't it be easier 
to just go to training?</b>

05:25.400 --> 05:26.910
<b>Even if it's just in name,</b>

05:26.990 --> 05:29.910
<b>he will be the successor 
to the shogunate one day.</b>

05:29.990 --> 05:33.620
<b>His cowardice and idleness set 
a bad example for the people.</b>

05:38.330 --> 05:39.420
<b>Tokiyuki.</b>

05:41.710 --> 05:44.630
<b>Father is frail, and on top of that, 
he lacks the conviction to rule.</b>

05:44.710 --> 05:47.510
<b>You'll do him a favor by taking 
over as soon as possible.</b>

05:47.590 --> 05:50.680
<b>What? But you're the firstborn.</b>

05:50.760 --> 05:52.430
<b>Not a chance.</b>

05:53.100 --> 05:56.560
<b>If the child of a concubine were to be 
appointed, it would disturb the peace.</b>

05:57.270 --> 06:01.400
<b>It's in our bloodline to run away in 
plain sight from anything we don't like.</b>

06:05.650 --> 06:07.490
<b>That's not something to be proud of.</b>

06:07.570 --> 06:09.200
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

06:09.280 --> 06:10.740
<b>I finally found you.</b>

06:10.820 --> 06:13.740
<b>Let's get to our archery practice!</b>

06:13.830 --> 06:15.040
<b>Come along!</b>

06:15.120 --> 06:16.410
<b>Come along!</b>

06:16.500 --> 06:19.330
<b>Come! Come! Come!</b>

06:20.460 --> 06:22.130
<b>Big brother, take the dog.</b>

06:23.210 --> 06:24.500
<b>Sure.</b>

06:30.800 --> 06:32.760
<b>-Tokiyuki! -Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

06:44.150 --> 06:46.230
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

06:49.070 --> 06:50.990
<b>Wait, please!</b>

06:56.080 --> 06:57.450
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

06:59.660 --> 07:01.170
<b>Lord Tokiyuki!</b>

07:08.880 --> 07:09.880
<b>My lord!</b>

07:10.720 --> 07:12.090
<b>My lord!</b>

07:18.520 --> 07:19.770
<b>Young Lord!</b>

07:44.460 --> 07:47.090
<b><i>I like this Kamakura.</i></b>

07:48.170 --> 07:51.880
<b><i>And I like to see its people 
smile as they live in peace.</i></b>

07:52.550 --> 07:54.680
<b><i>I don't need status or honor.</i></b>

07:55.180 --> 07:58.220
<b><i>Just living in this city is enough for me.</i></b>

07:59.470 --> 08:02.940
<b><i>Lazy, cowardly. Sure, that's fine.</i></b>

08:03.020 --> 08:07.110
<b><i>Why would a mere puppet like me 
need the power of pen and sword?</i></b>

08:10.070 --> 08:13.150
<b>You are not lazy, nor are you a coward.</b>

08:15.070 --> 08:18.740
<b>Those are merely aspects of the 
monster asleep within you.</b>

08:20.660 --> 08:22.410
<b>That is what Father says.</b>

08:23.000 --> 08:24.000
<b>Who are you?</b>

08:24.750 --> 08:25.830
<b>"Father"?</b>

08:25.920 --> 08:28.960
<b>You're quite the elusive 
boy, just as I've heard.</b>

08:30.260 --> 08:33.300
<b>What? Who's this? What's going on?</b>

08:33.380 --> 08:35.640
<b>Honored to make your acquaintance.</b>

08:35.720 --> 08:37.930
<b>I am a Shinto priest of Shinano Province.</b>

08:38.010 --> 08:40.020
<b>Yorishige Suwa.</b>

08:40.100 --> 08:42.270
<b>A Shinto priest from Shinano?</b>

08:42.350 --> 08:44.350
<b>Wait, since when did you climb up here?</b>

08:44.440 --> 08:46.060
<b>I've been up here all along.</b>

08:46.150 --> 08:49.610
<b>I foresaw a future where 
you'd climb this tree.</b>

08:50.230 --> 08:53.150
<b>You've got this incredible sort 
of aura around your head.</b>

08:54.110 --> 08:55.410
<b>Excuse me if it's blinding!</b>

08:55.490 --> 08:57.280
<b>I was born with an innate, 
sacred, holy power,</b>

08:57.370 --> 09:00.080
<b>and I just can't stop the flow sometimes!</b>

09:00.740 --> 09:01.870
<b>I'll dim it down.</b>

09:02.450 --> 09:07.250
<b>I came to pray for Kamakura. To pray 
for protection from its enemies.</b>

09:07.330 --> 09:11.130
<b>I have come to report to your father 
that it has been completed.</b>

09:11.710 --> 09:13.210
<b>This is Shizuku, my assistant.</b>

09:13.300 --> 09:15.180
<b>She is good at secret arts 
and general affairs,</b>

09:15.260 --> 09:17.390
<b>and so I have her help me out.</b>

09:17.970 --> 09:19.510
<b><i>What a suspicious man.</i></b>

09:19.600 --> 09:22.310
<b><i>How did he know I'd be up here?</i></b>

09:22.390 --> 09:25.560
<b>Father has the gift to see into the future.</b>

09:25.640 --> 09:27.690
<b>His prayers, on the other hand, are a sham.</b>

09:27.770 --> 09:29.860
<b>Shizuku, you didn't have 
to say that last part.</b>

09:29.940 --> 09:32.280
<b>Do you still doubt me? Let 
me demonstrate some more.</b>

09:33.990 --> 09:36.150
<b>Yes, I can see, Lord Tokiyuki,</b>

09:36.240 --> 09:38.740
<b>in the future…</b>

09:40.870 --> 09:42.080
<b>you will…</b>

09:42.580 --> 09:43.660
<b>No, that's not right.</b>

09:43.750 --> 09:45.710
<b>It's rather that…</b>

09:45.790 --> 09:46.870
<b>Actually, more like…</b>

09:48.960 --> 09:51.250
<b>I feel like… he'll live 
a happy life if he…</b>

09:51.340 --> 09:54.090
<b>Wait, happy by whose standards though?</b>

09:54.170 --> 09:55.510
<b>That'd work, but…</b>

09:55.590 --> 09:57.180
<b>that's more of a life lesson.</b>

09:57.260 --> 09:59.220
<b>For that…</b>

09:59.840 --> 10:02.850
<b>Well, it'll work out the way it's meant to?</b>

10:02.930 --> 10:03.930
<b>Excuse me?</b>

10:04.020 --> 10:05.850
<b>Everything you said was vague.</b>

10:05.930 --> 10:08.190
<b>I can only see in fragments!</b>

10:08.270 --> 10:10.980
<b>I'd spoil the fun if I saw everything!</b>

10:11.060 --> 10:13.320
<b>But I see something clearly now.</b>

10:13.400 --> 10:16.700
<b>If we were a comedy duo, you 
would be the straight man.</b>

10:16.780 --> 10:18.530
<b>That's because you're prattling nonsense!</b>

10:19.360 --> 10:22.280
<b>I also saw two years into your future.</b>

10:22.950 --> 10:24.120
<b>When you're ten years old,</b>

10:24.200 --> 10:27.910
<b>you will become a hero, to shake 
the very foundations of heaven.</b>

10:28.000 --> 10:30.080
<b>You will be a lord of war.</b>

10:30.170 --> 10:32.750
<b>Some will cower in fear. 
Others will worship you.</b>

10:32.840 --> 10:35.170
<b>You will even change the 
fate of the country.</b>

10:35.800 --> 10:37.720
<b>This is all I can foretell.</b>

10:37.800 --> 10:39.340
<b>You see, this is a very powerful…</b>

10:40.180 --> 10:42.050
<b>He's the size of a bean!</b>

10:42.550 --> 10:45.350
<b>Father, you revealed too much at once.</b>

10:46.310 --> 10:48.350
<b>What a finely attuned instinct 
for detecting danger.</b>

10:48.440 --> 10:50.400
<b>That was close.</b>

10:50.480 --> 10:54.270
<b>I don't get paid enough allowance 
to get involved with fake shamans.</b>

10:57.780 --> 10:59.610
<b><i>What a foolish man.</i></b>

10:59.700 --> 11:04.200
<b><i>Even if he tricks someone like me, all 
he'll get is surface-level glory.</i></b>

11:08.120 --> 11:13.460
<b><i>And he looked so serious 
when he called me a hero.</i></b>

11:16.340 --> 11:19.420
<b>I can't believe someone like 
that was just walking around.</b>

11:19.510 --> 11:21.090
<b>Seriously.</b>

11:23.140 --> 11:24.600
<b>He was seriously shady.</b>

11:27.060 --> 11:32.810
<b>But I think I know what 
this Mr. Yorishige meant.</b>

11:33.400 --> 11:37.570
<b>Your knack for elusiveness is 
nothing like mine or Father's.</b>

11:37.650 --> 11:42.490
<b>You'd definitely be a hero if 
the right opportunity arose.</b>

11:42.570 --> 11:44.370
<b>I have a gut feeling.</b>

11:46.830 --> 11:47.950
<b>Huh?</b>

11:48.040 --> 11:49.330
<b>What is it?</b>

11:49.410 --> 11:52.120
<b>No… Where did I kick it to?</b>

11:52.210 --> 11:53.920
<b>Maybe it's caught in a tree.</b>

12:07.140 --> 12:10.560
<b>We will now raid Kyo and 
suppress the uprising.</b>

12:11.480 --> 12:15.110
<b>May we have the God of 
War's divine protection!</b>

12:15.690 --> 12:17.690
<b>Let's go!</b>

12:31.660 --> 12:33.670
<b>Viceroy. Viceroy!</b>

12:33.750 --> 12:35.040
<b>I bring news.</b>

12:35.130 --> 12:38.290
<b>Takauji had been secretly communicating 
with Emperor Godaigo.</b>

12:38.380 --> 12:41.630
<b>Our army in Kyo has been annihilated!</b>

12:41.720 --> 12:44.680
<b>Samurai have gathered upon 
hearing of Takauji's valor.</b>

12:44.760 --> 12:47.510
<b><i>The Nitta Army has exploded 
in the blink of an eye!</i></b>

12:48.100 --> 12:50.140
<b><i>Even more, Takauji's eldest son, Senjuo,</i></b>

12:50.220 --> 12:52.640
<b><i>was entrusted to Yoshisada 
Nitta and appointed general.</i></b>

12:52.730 --> 12:56.150
<b>And they're sending the 
army towards Kamakura.</b>

12:59.070 --> 13:01.900
<b>MARTIAL ARTS INSTRUCTORS 
SABURO KANO AND JIRO SHIOTA</b>

13:01.990 --> 13:03.530
<b>DEATH IN BATTLE</b>

13:03.610 --> 13:05.660
<b>SHOGUNATE VASSAL CHIKAAKI OF SETTSU, SUICIDE</b>

13:11.040 --> 13:13.290
<b>HIS DAUGHTER KIYOKO VIOLATED 
AND BRUTALLY SLAIN</b>

13:15.870 --> 13:17.790
<b>FOR THE BOY TO BECOME A HERO…</b>

13:20.630 --> 13:22.550
<b>HE HAD TO LOSE EVERYTHING</b>

13:22.630 --> 13:26.010
<b>Damn you. Why have you betrayed us--</b>

13:29.260 --> 13:31.350
<b>I hear a voice.</b>

13:31.430 --> 13:32.930
<b>Who speaks to me?</b>

13:33.930 --> 13:37.850
<b>Who is it that guides me 
to be ruler above all?</b>

13:41.020 --> 13:42.480
<b>ABOUT 800 PEOPLE OF THE HOJO CLAN,</b>

13:42.570 --> 13:43.940
<b>INCLUDING RETAINERS, COMMITTED SUICIDE</b>

13:44.030 --> 13:45.900
<b>Father…</b>

13:46.570 --> 13:49.240
<b>MAY 1333 KAMAKURA SHOGUNATE LAY IN RUINS</b>

13:50.030 --> 13:52.330
<b>We've been waiting for you, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

13:54.370 --> 13:59.500
<b>In his last moments, your father 
commanded me to help you escape.</b>

13:59.580 --> 14:02.210
<b>He regrets such young life 
not seeing its days.</b>

14:02.710 --> 14:07.800
<b>I will shelter you in my 
territory of Suwa in Shinano.</b>

14:09.340 --> 14:11.510
<b>Yorishige Suwa…</b>

14:12.760 --> 14:13.970
<b>How come you're here?</b>

14:19.230 --> 14:20.770
<b>We're short on time.</b>

14:20.860 --> 14:21.860
<b>Now come.</b>

14:22.440 --> 14:25.320
<b>I foresaw this tragedy with my divine eye.</b>

14:25.900 --> 14:28.610
<b>We have been taking defensive 
measures for this event</b>

14:28.700 --> 14:30.370
<b>in the case of its slightest chance.</b>

14:30.450 --> 14:32.160
<b>My men and horses are hidden past this hill.</b>

14:32.240 --> 14:33.330
<b>We must go quickly.</b>

14:34.290 --> 14:35.290
<b>No.</b>

14:35.790 --> 14:39.370
<b>I'll end my life like 
my father and our clan.</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:40.960
<b>I won't allow it.</b>

14:41.040 --> 14:44.170
<b>What will happen to Japan 
if you were to die here?</b>

14:44.880 --> 14:46.210
<b>What of it?</b>

14:46.720 --> 14:49.180
<b>You know, it'll…</b>

14:51.890 --> 14:53.350
<b>I think…</b>

14:53.430 --> 14:56.470
<b>But who am I to decide that?</b>

14:56.560 --> 14:58.770
<b>I guess your death won't 
bring that big of a change.</b>

14:58.850 --> 15:02.060
<b>It may be a little… for those guys, but…</b>

15:02.900 --> 15:04.650
<b>Not that it's a big inconvenience…</b>

15:11.280 --> 15:12.490
<b>It's hell on earth.</b>

15:14.200 --> 15:19.750
<b>Kamakura is being completely destroyed 
by the traitorous samurai.</b>

15:24.670 --> 15:26.250
<b>Takauji Ashikaga.</b>

15:26.920 --> 15:29.380
<b>For him to be this thorough…</b>

15:33.140 --> 15:35.930
<b>Takauji…</b>

15:41.940 --> 15:42.770
<b>Who are you?</b>

15:43.520 --> 15:45.730
<b>I'm a vassal from Shimotsuke.</b>

15:45.820 --> 15:47.650
<b>Takauji Ashikaga.</b>

15:48.940 --> 15:52.360
<b>Young Lord, you can't run from Takauji!</b>

15:54.530 --> 15:57.290
<b><i>That smile of his before…</i></b>

15:57.950 --> 15:59.660
<b><i>Was it all a lie?</i></b>

16:00.790 --> 16:03.040
<b>Let's get revenge, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

16:03.120 --> 16:06.090
<b>I, Yorishige, will help you.</b>

16:07.090 --> 16:11.150
<b><i>This smile is also a lie. 
It's absolutely a lie.</i></b>

16:10.090 --> 16:11.090
<b>LOOMING</b>

16:11.170 --> 16:12.470
<b>Go away.</b>

16:12.550 --> 16:15.510
<b>Do you really think I could 
trust a fake shaman like you?</b>

16:15.600 --> 16:16.890
<b>How rude!</b>

16:16.970 --> 16:21.270
<b>You dare call me a fake while I am 
simply overflowing with holy energy?</b>

16:21.350 --> 16:24.940
<b>Father, a fake is a fake, 
so don't make excuses.</b>

16:25.020 --> 16:26.440
<b>My own Shizuku! Back me up!</b>

16:27.070 --> 16:29.400
<b>We can't avenge my father.</b>

16:30.110 --> 16:31.860
<b>It's obvious if you look.</b>

16:32.740 --> 16:37.450
<b>Even for Yoritomo Minamoto, it took 
five years to defeat the Heike clan.</b>

16:38.160 --> 16:43.500
<b>Was there a man before Takauji who 
destroyed an entire country in 24 days?</b>

16:44.500 --> 16:49.300
<b><i>The other day, you spouted nonsense 
that I would become a hero,</i></b>

16:50.010 --> 16:53.430
<b><i>but future generations 
will only apply that word</i></b>

16:53.510 --> 16:56.050
<b><i>to someone strong like Takauji Ashikaga.</i></b>

16:56.640 --> 17:00.310
<b><i>Since I've been defeated, it would 
be a disgrace if I didn't die.</i></b>

17:00.890 --> 17:06.600
<b>So let me die like an honorable 
warrior, like my people did.</b>

17:06.690 --> 17:07.810
<b>Very well.</b>

17:07.900 --> 17:09.230
<b>Then die.</b>

17:35.800 --> 17:37.930
<b>It's the Hojo child!</b>

18:04.750 --> 18:10.170
<b><i>When you're in the depths of despair 
and thrown into the abyss of death…</i></b>

18:12.920 --> 18:13.920
<b>Hey.</b>

18:22.390 --> 18:26.850
<b><i>…that is where the hero within you shines!</i></b>

18:29.480 --> 18:32.650
<b>Hey. I could have died.</b>

18:38.860 --> 18:41.240
<b>You said it would be a 
disgrace if you didn't die,</b>

18:41.320 --> 18:44.290
<b>yet you jumped out of 
there to save your skin.</b>

18:44.910 --> 18:46.830
<b>That was the hero in you.</b>

18:48.120 --> 18:52.090
<b>Running and hiding are 
good skills for a hero.</b>

18:52.170 --> 18:54.130
<b>Above! Shoot to kill!</b>

18:59.260 --> 19:03.050
<b>Your survival instinct is monstrous.</b>

19:03.560 --> 19:05.930
<b>You know better than anyone how to survive.</b>

19:06.020 --> 19:09.640
<b>You love the tingling tension 
between life and death.</b>

19:10.980 --> 19:17.440
<b>What a pain for Takauji who just killed 
our lord and took a whole country.</b>

19:18.030 --> 19:19.900
<b>Because the one he should 
definitely kill next,</b>

19:19.990 --> 19:22.160
<b>the one who will inherit 
the Kamakura shogunate,</b>

19:22.240 --> 19:25.200
<b>has more talent than anyone to escape death.</b>

19:30.120 --> 19:35.960
<b><i>Takauji becomes a hero by killing, 
and you become a hero by living.</i></b>

19:36.960 --> 19:40.550
<b><i>You two are heroes with opposed fates.</i></b>

19:41.470 --> 19:45.260
<b><i>Of course, you can't win 
if you only run and hide.</i></b>

19:45.970 --> 19:48.520
<b><i>Allies, military strength, intellect…</i></b>

19:48.600 --> 19:51.600
<b><i>Everything you need to 
win, I will give to you.</i></b>

19:52.350 --> 19:58.990
<b>As long as you're breathing, Takauji will 
eventually come to kill you himself.</b>

19:59.650 --> 20:03.240
<b><i>Till then, you'll run and 
hide, become stronger,</i></b>

20:03.320 --> 20:05.030
<b><i>and defeat the demons that come for you.</i></b>

20:05.830 --> 20:09.790
<b>Now, it's time to start the game 
of tag to reclaim the throne!</b>

20:37.230 --> 20:40.490
<b>Mr. Yorishige, what do you really want?</b>

20:41.240 --> 20:44.410
<b>What do you gain by saving the 
child of a ruined country?</b>

20:44.490 --> 20:47.910
<b>It is all for my devotion to the Hojo clan!</b>

20:47.990 --> 20:52.330
<b>If a fake shaman were to say that, 
I doubt you would believe it.</b>

20:52.910 --> 20:54.790
<b>I'll tell you everything someday.</b>

20:55.330 --> 20:59.000
<b>When you take back Kamakura.</b>

21:02.550 --> 21:05.300
<b>I'm a disgrace.</b>

21:06.220 --> 21:08.390
<b>As the son of a samurai,</b>

21:09.060 --> 21:12.600
<b>I'm supposed to be dead alongside my people.</b>

21:14.520 --> 21:18.730
<b>Because of you, I've awakened 
to the joy of living.</b>

21:19.900 --> 21:23.530
<b>Mr. Yorishige, I'll have you 
take responsibility for this.</b>

21:24.820 --> 21:26.450
<b>Of course.</b>

21:27.120 --> 21:29.740
<b>I will serve you unto the pits of hell.</b>

21:34.330 --> 21:36.290
<b><i>Just as Yorishige prophesied,</i></b>

21:36.370 --> 21:40.550
<b><i>in two years, Tokiyuki 
would shake all of Japan.</i></b>

21:44.760 --> 21:48.050
<b><i>In a time when death is the honorable path,</i></b>

21:48.140 --> 21:54.310
<b><i>this boy outraced all that befell him 
and attempted to overthrow the shogun.</i></b>

21:55.560 --> 22:01.650
<b><i>Thus began the tumultuous life 
of the elusive samurai prince!</i></b>

22:22.590 --> 22:24.840
<b>NANBOKUCHO - REIWA</b>

22:26.260 --> 22:27.180
<b>1185 KAMAKURA</b>

22:27.260 --> 22:28.180
<b>1192 PARADISE</b>

22:33.810 --> 22:37.560
<b>ELUSIVE SAMURAI</b>

23:14.600 --> 23:15.720
<b>KAMAKURA</b>

23:39.000 --> 23:40.180
<b>EPISODE 2 (YEAR OF 1333): THE GENTLE UNCLE</b>
